where we're not sending

00:15:23.960 --> 00:15:26.200
a lot of troops off to
another country to die.

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:27.990
And that's the cause of action.

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:31.670
But what ought to be the cause
of action is their freedom

00:15:31.670 --> 00:15:35.220
and Liberty and the baseline of truth

00:15:35.220 --> 00:15:38.110
by which we can actually
function as a democracy

00:15:38.110 --> 00:15:41.163
'cause without it, you don't
and you can't, and you won't.

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:46.110
- I certainly agree the, I know
we don't have a lot of time

00:15:46.110 --> 00:15:49.990
