We engage in campus behaviors
to try to change our own

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:16.930
make ourselves accountable

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:21.670
for the cost of carbon
we emit and be a model.

00:16:21.670 --> 00:16:24.770
And we recently announced
some new guidelines

00:16:24.770 --> 00:16:27.540
by which we're gonna evaluate
holdings in our endowment

