extraction is concerned.

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:39.450
Very recently, we received
a very large gift from FedEx

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:43.700
to support research as part of this

00:16:44.970 --> 00:16:46.480
planetary solutions project

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:51.023
to support research on natural
methods of carbon capture.

00:16:52.340 --> 00:16:55.360
And I'd be interested if you have,

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:58.630
