00:18:03.610 --> 00:18:04.720
Not, will we move?

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:06.180
Ultimately, we're gonna get there.

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:09.450
And a certain percentage of
the population of the planet

00:18:09.450 --> 00:18:12.810
will kind of learn how they'll
adapt and things will happen.

00:18:12.810 --> 00:18:14.460
And we'll waste a lot
of money doing things

00:18:14.460 --> 00:18:18.820
we never should have had to
do to survive as a species.

00:18:18.820 --> 00:18:20.310
But a lot of people won't

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:23.900
there will be a massive
dislocation of human beings

00:18:23.900 --> 00:18:26.800
with major food, disruption
and other challenges.

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:30.000
So the issue here is
speeding everything up.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.950
If we can find ways to speed it up

00:18:32.950 --> 00:18:36.530
we've got a much better
chance of arresting

00:18:36.530 --> 00:18:40.270
