00:18:47.470 --> 00:18:48.940
And so that's what I'd say.

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:52.070
I mean, you know Bill Gates in his book

00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:55.210
sights that we need the
one of three miracles,

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:57.520
the miracle of storage,
the miracle of fusion,

00:18:57.520 --> 00:19:01.450
or the miracle efficient,
and he's pursuing the fusion

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:05.140
with a next generation
model nuclear reactor

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:07.570
which has a lot of promise.

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:12.570
But the fact is that the science
has tell me that about 50%

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:19.050
