but those are the biggies and nothing.

00:19:56.510 --> 00:19:58.720
Anybody who can find a way we got

00:19:58.720 --> 00:20:01.040
we had a serious methane challenge

00:20:01.040 --> 00:20:03.380
because of the melting of the permafrost

00:20:03.380 --> 00:20:05.290
and the melting of the tundra

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:10.290
and the massive exposure of
30 and 40,000 year frozen land

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:15.590
to a thawing is emitting massive amount

00:20:15.590 --> 00:20:20.310
of heretofore contained
methane and methane is

00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:26.240
20 to 80 times more damaging,
more destructive than CO2.

00:20:26.350 --> 00:20:29.810
And it's now coming out in
amounts that are truly alarming

00:20:29.810 --> 00:20:33.020
which will also exacerbate the gas debate

00:20:33.020 --> 00:20:37.500
because gas is 87.7% methane

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:41.320
and it leaks, it leaks far
more in other countries

00:20:41.320 --> 00:20:44.380
than here that we're
at about a 5% leakage.

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:49.380
And you add to that the
untapped unplugged wells

00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:53.110
and mines from which methane is escaping.

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:55.180
One of President Biden's priorities

00:20:55.180 --> 00:20:58.210
