There are about four or five
of them and more coming,

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:35.920
so we can accelerate this.

00:22:35.920 --> 00:22:40.920
And I see just fantastic
opportunity to make America fairer,

00:22:42.830 --> 00:22:45.110
to deal with environmental injustice

00:22:45.110 --> 00:22:47.807
that has characterized
a lot of the build out

00:22:47.807 --> 00:22:50.483
and development of the last 40 50 years.

00:22:56.190 --> 00:22:59.830
I think create millions, not, I think

00:22:59.830 --> 00:23:04.336
all of the job analysis for
the long-term future show

00:23:04.336 --> 00:23:09.336
that there are far far
more jobs to be created

00:23:10.260 --> 00:23:12.810
in by going whole hog into this arena

00:23:12.810 --> 00:23:14.640
of cleaning up the planet

00:23:15.520 --> 00:23:18.480
and building out the new systems

00:23:18.480 --> 00:23:21.240
that will modernize our
nations, lengthen our lives,

00:23:21.240 --> 00:23:24.950
and increase the quality of
life, make us more secure.

00:23:24.950 --> 00:23:26.300
All of those things.

00:23:26.300 --> 00:23:29.180
And every economic analysis shows

00:23:29.180 --> 00:23:33.420
